    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not that easy. even just being around my kid feels like a performance now. i'm just waiting for the moment it all makes sense, or for it to finally stop feeling so heavy. sometimes i look at everything i've done, and i feel like the work is done. like i've done my part and there's no reason to keep dragging this out if the purpose is gone. does that even make sense? that you can just be... finished?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
